  "transcript": "Open AI just admitted [music] that the top 10% of companies are six times more likely to use AI skills than you are. The winning companies are not prompting [music] better than you. They just saved any repeatable process as a skill. And the best part is you don't have to write a single one. There is a free repo with over 2,000 skills already created. And if you don't know which one to use, you can just [music] ask the AI and it will scroll through all possible skills and recommend the most suitable one for your use case. Comment awesome and I will send you the link to all 2,000 skills. If you want to stay at the cutting edge of AI, hit subscribe for more content like this.",
